            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "NVIDIA, Wingtech, Xiaomi, Big Bear: Trending Stocks",
            "description": "<p>Chinese chip company Wingtech (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/600745.SS\">600745.SS</a>) sees shares dive after the Netherlands took control of its Dutch arm. Tesla (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TSLA\">TSLA</a>) isn't the only EV company struggling with handle design: Xiaomi  (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/1810.HK\">1810.HK</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/XIACF\">XIACF</a>) stocks fall after a tragic fatal accident. Big Bear AI (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BBAI\">BBAI</a>) is climbing after confirming a new contract with the U.S. Navy. And as NVIDIA (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>), Oracle (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ORCL\">ORCL</a>) and other Big AI stocks recover Friday's losses in pre-market, Applied Digital (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/APLD\">APLD</a>) continues to rise, powered by data center deals with CoreWeave (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CRWV\">CRWV</a>) and others.</p>\n<p>For more live coverage of markets watch the full episode of<a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cLr6hc2-oMY&list=PLx28zU8ctIRqTE7Y4uXTY-S2oHlwDsL5c\"> Market Sunrise</a> and head to<a data-i13n=\"cpos:11;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/\"> Yahoo Finance</a>.</p>",
